<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective Nov 21 to 27:</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 109.77</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 104.67</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  57.65</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$  96.58</p>
</text>
